{"id":15622,"date":"2022-03-01T07:38:52","date_gmt":"2022-03-01T07:38:52","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/demo1.cmykhosting.com\/?page_id=3"},"modified":"2024-10-23T09:31:33","modified_gmt":"2024-10-23T09:31:33","slug":"privacy-policy","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/hexmaxcreations.com\/privacy-policy\/","title":{"rendered":"Privacy Policy"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"15622\" class=\"elementor elementor-15622\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-5de72cd elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"5de72cd\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-366d3d07\" data-id=\"366d3d07\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-61657560 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"61657560\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Privacy Policy for Hexmax Creations<\/span><\/strong><\/h3>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Effective Date: October 21, 2024<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Hexmax Creations (&#8220;we,&#8221; &#8220;us,&#8221; or &#8220;our&#8221;) respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the personal information you choose to provide. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, and protect your information when using our services or visiting our website.<\/span><\/p>\n<h4><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\"> Information We Collect<\/span><\/strong><\/h4>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">We may collect the following types of information from users:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Personal Data: The nature of information includes your name, email address, phone number, and any other information that you provide to us by filling out forms or other direct methods of communication.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Technical Data: This may include IP addresses, type of browser used, type of operating system, and type of device, all for improvements <\/span><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">about<\/span><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\"> user experience and potential requirements<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Service-Related Information: We collect details related to the services you engage with, including project requirements, preferences, and communication records<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\"> How We Use Your Information<\/span><\/strong><\/h4>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">We apply the information we collect by this Privacy Policy. These uses include:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Operating, providing, and maintaining our services<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Communicating with you regarding projects, updates, and support<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Personalizing your experience with our services<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">We are keen to improve our <\/span><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">websites<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Processing, under contract, any transactions and payments<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Ensuring compliance with any applicable legal obligation.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\"> Sharing Information<\/span><\/strong><\/h4>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">We don&#8217;t sell, trade, or transfer to third parties personally identifiable information. However, we may share such information in such a way as in the following cases:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">With Service Providers: We may share your information with trusted third-party service providers to help us operate our business (for example, payment processors, and<\/span> <span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">hosting services) under confidentiality agreements.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">For Legal Reasons: We may disclose your information if we are required to do so by law or in response to valid requests by governmental authorities.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\"> Data Security<\/span><\/strong><\/h4>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">We use reasonable measures to protect personal data from unauthorized access, interference, and disclosure. <\/span><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Notwithstanding the <\/span><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">foregoing<\/span><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">, please note that no means of electronic storage is infallible, and we can <\/span><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">make no guarantee whatsoever of<\/span><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\"> absolute security.<\/span><\/p>\n<h4><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\"> Data Retention<\/span><\/strong><\/h4>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">We will retain your data for such a period as is reasonably necessary to fulfil the purpose of this Privacy Policy or as otherwise required by law.<\/span><\/p>\n<h4><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\"> International Data Transfer<\/span><\/strong><\/h4>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Since Hexmax Creations operates in several countries <\/span><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">including<\/span><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\"> the USA, Canada, UAE, and UK, your personal data is transferred and possibly processed outside of your country. <\/span><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Any<\/span><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\"> international data transfers <\/span><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">are made by us<\/span><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\"> in compliance with the applicable data protection laws.<\/span><\/p>\n<h4><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\"> Cookies and Tracking Technologies<\/span><\/strong><\/h4>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to enhance user experience and analyze website traffic. You can control the use of cookies through your browser settings, though this may limit some <\/span><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">features of the website<\/span><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<h4><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\"> Rights<\/span><\/strong><\/h4>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Depending on your location, you may have the following rights regarding your data:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">The right to access, correct, or delete your personal information.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Right to withdraw or object to process your data.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Right to portability of your data<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Right to withdraw consent at any given time (if applicable).<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">To exercise the rights, kindly reach out to us at info@hexmaxcreations.com.<\/span><\/p>\n<h4><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\"> Links to Third-Party Sites<\/span><\/strong><\/h4>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Our website contains links to other websites. Third-party websites. Hexmax Creations Inc. does not control and is not responsible for the privacy practices of the websites accessible through hyperlinks from this website. In addition, when you leave our website by clicking on a hyperlink to a third-party site, you should read that site&#8217;s privacy policy before providing any personally identifiable information.<\/span><\/p>\n<h4><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\"> Changes in the Policy<\/span><\/strong><\/h4>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">We may revise this Privacy Policy from time to time. <\/span><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Whenever we do so,<\/span><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\"> we will make the new terms available by noting the date at the top of this page.<\/span><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\"> Your continued use of our services after such changes constitutes your acceptance of such changes.<\/span><\/p>\n<h4><strong><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Contact Us<\/span><\/strong><\/h4>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, feel free to contact us:<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Hexmax Creations<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span data-preserver-spaces=\"true\">Email: info@hexmaxcreations.com<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Privacy Policy for Hexmax Creations Effective Date: October 21, 2024 Hexmax Creations (&#8220;we,&#8221; &#8220;us,&#8221; or &#8220;our&#8221;) respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the personal information you choose to provide. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, and protect your information when using our services or visiting our website. Information We Collect We [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","me